<title>USA: Santa Monica Bank ups dividend.</title>
<headline>Santa Monica Bank ups dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Monica Bank said it for the second quarter of 1997, its board increased its dividend to $0.10 per share from $0.08 per share the previous quarter, to be paid on May 30, 1997 to stockholders of record as of May 15, 1997.</p>
